{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25920","headline":"会仙歌 · 鲍溶","name":"会仙歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻轻蒙蒙，龙言凤语何从容。\n耳有响兮目无踪，杳杳默默。\n花张锦织，王[母]初自崑仑来。\n茅盈王方平在侧，青毛仙鸟衔锦符。\n谨上阿环起居王母书，始知僊事亦多故。\n一隔绦河千岁余，详玉字。\n多喜气，瑶台明月来堕地。\n冠劒低昂蹈舞频，礼容尽若君臣事。\n愿言小仙艺，姓名许飞琼。\n洞阴玉磬敲天声，乐王[母]，一送玉杯长命酒。\n碧花醉，灵扬扬，笑赐二子长生方。\n二子未及伸拜谢，苍苍上兮皇皇下。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}